Function:
public class Ceil {
public static int ceil(int value, int interval) {
        if (value == 0)
            return 0;
        if (interval == 0)
            return 0;
        if (value < 0)
            interval *= -1;
        int mod = value % interval;
        return mod == 0 ? value : value + interval - mod;
    }
}

Test Case:
