Function:
public class PowRetainingSign {
public static double powRetainingSign(double d, double power) {
        // In case d is super small, just make it zero
        if (Math.abs(d) < 1e-14) {
            return 0;
        }
        return Math.copySign(Math.pow(Math.abs(d), power), d);
    }
}

Test Case:
