Function:
public class IsClockwise {
public boolean isClockwise(double aX, double aY, double bX, double bY, double cX, double cY) {
        // simply compare angles between a,b and b,c
        final double angleDiff = (cX - aX) * (bY - aY) - (cY - aY) * (bX - aX);
        return angleDiff < 0;
    }
}

Test Case:
