Function:
public class FloorDiv {
public static long floorDiv(long x, long y) {
    long r = x / y;
    // if the signs are different and modulo not zero, round down
    if ((x ^ y) < 0 && (r * y != x)) {
      r--;
    }
    return r;
  }
}

Test Case:
